			"notes": "- NEW: COMPLETE REWRITE OF THE MOD!\nThe color of the glint is now sorted into different categories depending on when it is rendered.\n- Held Item Glint Color\n- GUI Item Glint Color\n- Dropped Item Glint Color\n- Framed Item Glint Color\n- Armor Glint Color\nIt is now also possible to split the glint color into two different colors, as well as change its speed, rotation, and scale.\n\nThere are now additional options for Shiny Pots:\n- Render the shiny pot overlay over the full slot instead of just the normal item space\n- Render only the shiny pot overlay and not the potion's enchantment glint\n\nhttps://github.com/Polyfrost/GlintColorizer/assets/45589059/1f81b65d-3025-484c-b481-54fd9da44cac"
		},
