			"notes": "- **Add OneConfig**\nOneConfig is a free and open-source configuration library, designed to give developers a simple config API, which users can interact with in an elegant user interface. You can now simply click `R-SHIFT` on your keyboard to access any mod that uses OneConfig or supports it (any Vigilance mod, NEU, etc).\nTo find out more, join https://discord.gg/polyfrost.\n\n- Remove OneCore / Essential\n- Allow potion glint to apply everywhere\n- Add dependency for potionGlintType\n- Port to 1.12.2"
